  <RHAH_Menu_Genes_NoBiotech>Biotech is required. With it, you can set the xenotypes of visitors here.</RHAH_Menu_Genes_NoBiotech>
  <RHAH_Menu_Genes_Note>Bar length is the current chance. Drag a bar to set a weight from 0 to 100. A xenotype at 0 stays out of the draw. At all zeroes, visitors use the base ratkin xenotype. If that xenotype is missing, they use the famine ratkin xenotype.</RHAH_Menu_Genes_Note>
  <RHAH_Menu_Genes_Reset>Reset weights</RHAH_Menu_Genes_Reset>
  <RHAH_Menu_Genes_Fallback>The enabled weights add up to 0. Visitors use the base ratkin xenotype. If that xenotype is missing, they use the famine ratkin xenotype.</RHAH_Menu_Genes_Fallback>
  <RHAH_Menu_Genes_WeightTip>Suggested weight {1}. Chance is this weight divided by the sum of enabled weights.</RHAH_Menu_Genes_WeightTip>
