  <RHAH_Menu_Experimental_Note>These options change how long visitors take to generate. With one off, visitors still use each incident's own apparel, history, health, and genes.</RHAH_Menu_Experimental_Note>
  <RHAH_Settings_OptimizeGeneration>Speed up visitor generation</RHAH_Settings_OptimizeGeneration>
  <RHAH_Settings_OptimizeGeneration_Tooltip>Skips relations, titles, random apparel, and redressing world pawns. Incidents without a set xenotype draw from the gene page weights. If those weights are unavailable, visitors use the base ratkin xenotype. If that xenotype is missing, they use the famine ratkin xenotype.</RHAH_Settings_OptimizeGeneration_Tooltip>
  <RHAH_Menu_Frequency_Gap>Each pool fires on its own average interval. 0 turns that pool off. Weight still changes with season, plague, and trust.</RHAH_Menu_Frequency_Gap>
